'''Description:''' Clerics who take the Protection domain are able to shield themselves from harm using their special abilities and spells.[[Image:Id protection.gif|right|Protection]]
== Domain special abilities ==

Divine protection - The [[cleric]] is able to cast an improved form of [[sanctuary]] that sets the save [[difficulty class|DC]] at 10 + [[charisma]] [[modifier]] + [[class level|clerical level]]. The effect has a duration of 1 [[round]] per [[caster level]] + charisma modifier.

== Bonus spells ==

* Level 4 [[Minor globe of invulnerability]]
* Level 5 [[Energy buffer]]

== Notes ==

* ''Divine protection'' can be used once per [[day]].

